  "note": "The Arabic goat name directly supports the animal sense. Scripture offers no comparable explanation connecting the goat to readiness. SEDRA 2432–2434 attest the Syriac words. The personal name Athaiah lacks the root’s final daleth and the account in Nehemiah 11:4 gives no naming explanation."
